    backlog:hasAuditNote "Page 03-materials/ch11/page/sen0414_ch11_page_v9_99_3.html on template 9.53.5. Inputs: domain A-box 1.0.1 (03-materials/ch11/rdodi) made by maker 08-tooling/ch11-page/abox_lambda_free_make_v1_0_0.py (42 inputs rewritten without lambda, old and new results equal 42 of 42), examples_out 3.0.0, story pictures 9.99.3 (the existing mapping), manifest 1.1.0. Made with page-data builder 2.28.0 and page builder 4.18.3 (PAGE_VER=9_99_3, PAGE_TEMPLATE=course_page_template_v9_53_5.html); input maker 08-tooling/ch11-page/page_inputs_make_v9_99_3.py." .
