    backlog:hasAuditNote "Logs in 08-tooling/ch11-page/logs_v9_99_3: full page test 9.39.0 through the key-substituting runner, 416 features passed, 0 failed; the chapter-code tab lists the 19 deck examples in slide order; material check 1.0.2 on deck and page all conditions pass (no prompt lines, no lambda, code in page); manifest self-check pass; story layout probe pass at 1366x768, 1400x900 and 390x844 for 4 stories. First run of the page test failed only because the real instructor key is not in this environment; rerun through the runner that supplies a TEST key." .
ex:TK10_Release_11_Build backlog:hasState backlog:Done ;
    backlog:hasAuditNote "Review record 08-tooling/ch11-deck/logs_v3_0_0/REVIEW_RECORD_ch11_v1_0_0.md: four reviewed conditions times three roles, 12 verdicts, labelled agent-made and not independent." .
ex:TK10_Release_11_Verify backlog:hasState backlog:Done ;
    backlog:hasAuditNote "Every automatic check was re-run from the files after the page build and equals the record. Open and said plainly: links not re-opened today, story facts carried over and not re-checked against sources, re-cut story wording unread by the owner, two builder line-room warnings (walk, zipmodes)." .
